cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this style, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TED Classroom Subtitles"
abstract: >-
  A Stylus user style (CSS) that makes TED talk subtitles easier to read on
  classroom displays and projectors, with configurable subtitle size and
  subtitle area width. Client-side only: no JavaScript, tracking or network
  requests.
authors:
